{"about_the_game":"Hidden Words is an interactive word guessing game that can be played with your <strong>Twitch chat</strong>! Your viewers will try to find the hidden words in a picture by just typing to your chat. You can also play by yourself with the solo game mode without a twitch account.<br><br>At each level there are 5 words that needs to be found. A hint will be provided to help the players find these words. Players will get points with each word they find.<br><br>Hidden Words is available in multiple languages and more languages will be coming soon. Have a fun activity with your Twitch chat with over 150 levels. Find out the best observers among your viewers or challange yourself by playing the solo mode.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1744050?t=1726261644","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1744050?t=1726261644","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744050/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1726261644","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744050/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1726261644","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Hidden Words is an interactive word guessing game that can be played with your <strong>Twitch chat</strong>! Your viewers will try to find the hidden words in a picture by just typing to your chat. You can also play by yourself with the solo game mode without a twitch account.<br><br>At each level there are 5 words that needs to be found. A hint will be provided to help the players find these words. Players will get points with each word they find.<br><br>Hidden Words is available in multiple languages and more languages will be comi